# No Co-authored-by on commits

When creating git commits in this repo:

- Do **not** add `Co-authored-by:` (or any similar co-author / generated-with / Cursor trailer) to the commit message.
- Subject and body only.
- If the environment injects `Co-authored-by` via a normal `git commit`, rewrite with `git commit-tree` (or equivalent) so the final commit has no such trailer before push.
- Do not invent authorship trailers for Cursor or other tools unless the user explicitly asks.
